+/* GIMP - The GNU Image Manipulation Program
+ * Copyright (C) 1995 Spencer Kimball and Peter Mattis
+ *
+ * chopgimp-artboards-panel.c — ChopGimp 3.31.0 (lot 4a): the « Plans de
+ * travail » dockable (Illustrator's Artboards panel) and the « Exporter
+ * les plans de travail » dialog
+ *
+ *    01  Couverture      2480 × 3508
+ *    02  Page 2          2480 × 3508      (the active one is selected)
+ *    [+] [⎘] [🗑] [↑] [↓] [Aa] [⤢] [▭] [⇲] [💾]
